{"version":1,"content":"<p>網絡安全公司趨勢科技旗下的零日漏洞計劃 ZDI 團隊日前將多份漏洞報告抄送給公開的 Linux Kernel Mailing List，其中有兩項遠程代碼執行漏洞的評分高達 9.0 分。這裏面有部分漏洞並未修復因此不應該公開，從郵件頭部信息來看應該是報告發送給內核安全團隊的同時不慎抄送給公開列表。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583470.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:23:45.128622+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.782982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.782982+00:00","content_hash":"e1d0b429f30ae32dd6ba75bdb78080e6dcf161123f3966367a164b5ee8fe5af2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}